{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_title", "source_sha256": "99bdc72e1de52daf4fb3c90fcced88780455956a3093f7c6a24fbb503fd5d178", "ja": "ワタシは、アナタの", "zh": "我是、你的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7cef9f17915eb56950fc4088aee79d9c6db31f7027324807e1c7173d57ad7a0d", "ja": "エレナ達の曲がドラマの挿入歌候補になる。\n仲間と争いたくないから辞退すると言う恵美\nと、仲間だからこそ競いたいと言うエレナ。\nふたりは仲直りするが、その過程、エレナの\n心には言葉にできない何かが残る。", "zh": "艾莲娜等人的歌曲成为了电视剧插曲的候选。\n惠美表示不想和同伴争夺因而想要退出，\n而艾莲娜则认为正因为是同伴才更想竞争。\n两人虽然和好了，但在这个过程中，\n艾莲娜的心中却留下了某种难以言表的情感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "74541b54d897169544631dfdcf0138dd3869aabf08a15552201ba7848055482b", "ja": "（エレナの新曲お披露公演が終わった。\n切ない歌声に、会場中が魅了されたみたいだ……）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜的新曲首次公演结束了。她那动人而略带伤感的歌声，似乎让整个会场都为之着迷……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "455c0f89c15b8404c8d0b1059ee4cb0629237f7f818c72e5e79d86c28fbafd8d", "ja": "お疲れさま、エレナ。\nいいステージだったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，艾莲娜。\n刚才的舞台很棒啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ac7159f38a313e59fcaf736b57ed70ed2b58d12d5a5ecb73553a0a201ab1a38", "ja": "{$P$}……エヘヘ。\nホント？　だったらうれしいナ……♪", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n真的吗？那样的话我会很开心哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "255cd0c3a57ca6566cc809c76843a22a9067f9c656116840ab3e959b784d192a", "ja": "自分、なんか見ててドキドキしたぞ……。\nエレナ、どんな特訓したんだ？", "zh": "我刚才看得都有点心跳加速了……\n艾蕾娜，你到底接受了什么特训啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "b920ff74b326f6588f95ad5e3df2a165db1ee2e3747a0493e6b7b1d19fe7151d", "ja": "お、オレもドキドキした！　練習の時とぜんぜん\n違うからビックリしたよ。すっげー大人っぽくて……。", "zh": "我、我也看得心怦怦跳！和练习时完全不一样，吓了我一跳。特别有成熟女人的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "1cb9d73301d4b264d571aca9b2eed5cc2084993a894873303eb88da23dced29b", "ja": "まあ、そういう曲だからね～。\nエレナだし、これくらい当然っしょ！", "zh": "嘛，毕竟就是这样的曲子嘛～。是艾丽娜嘛，这种程度当然不在话下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "aac46f3ee48c1972645396e0ddacb2571d674d4cfa4bbae7d9c19bb966909fe5", "ja": "ふたりとも、すっかり元通りですわね。\nいえ、以前より仲良くなったのではなくて？", "zh": "两位都已经完全恢复原样了呢。不，应该说，关系变得比以前更好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "70835247c73b3fccf8eb0f0b23332a5eabde74d9f67406ef5f6069ee84416f68", "ja": "そういえば、ケンカしてたんだって？\nあとで聞いて、びっくりしたさー。珍しいよね！", "zh": "说起来，你们之前吵架了来着？\n我后来听说时，可吓了一跳——真少见啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "b7a2d77bf08d1502b5b76fdc0c042296a15b0b468c5b3e56fdfffb7a214a3b22", "ja": "みんな、心配かけてごめんネ。\nあのあと、コトハにも怒られちゃったんだヨー。", "zh": "让大家担心了，对不起捏。\n那之后，也被琴叶狠狠说了呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "17afd995703a9fb856d7f1a927a08ba905117a8409f1c7a86d993a006c287757", "ja": "琴葉、すごい剣幕だったよね。\n「ふたりして何やってるの！」って。", "zh": "琴叶当时气势汹汹的呢。\n“你们两个到底在干什么！”她这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d3396e3a2d82e6d89cb66ebe28c8b2bd9d19e99acc710093485ce25d4b89156", "ja": "そうだな……俺も一緒に怒られたしな……。", "zh": "是啊……我也跟着一起挨训了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "ebd0b31fc7d184e655c3f63d4c75993dc3b4a694a8b3e7d02e66ee46e4189e55", "ja": "あはは、それ琴葉っぽい！ でも公演\n上手くいったし、よろこんでるんじゃない？", "zh": "哈哈，这很像琴叶！不过公演进行得很顺利，她应该也很高兴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "e90ce256709009e5390af9ce9884cbe175f0817f483680988d9416ae1201fedb", "ja": "琴葉、客席で見てるんだよね？\nじゃあ、早く戻って報告するさー！", "zh": "琴叶，你是在观众席看着的吧？那我得赶紧回去向你汇报啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1013_p", "source_sha256": "00c2389f31e001d2b5985d09c5b8386e65ca712f55c51748a65ac7cfbbe1b60c", "ja": "エレナ。", "zh": "艾莲娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "f71434b4fb665436b068af290a263a8d0caef3aad2c3ca38dd1fedd60613665d", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとね。\nワタシ、がんばったヨ。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你哦。\n我已经努力过了哟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f25765ae6ca6f408d361e4fcc3e8fc3c974738e3394725fed0357838c90389c6", "ja": "ああ。ステージは、良かったと思うんだけど……\nエレナ、もしかして悩みでもあるのか？", "zh": "啊。我觉得舞台表现还不错，不过……\n艾蕾娜，你是不是有什么烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f1f10e5a853836a864ea0edc04431e318bbf7741f4cbdf921fb3f7a7d921c0ab", "ja": "何か、いつもと雰囲気が違うから……。", "zh": "因为感觉……你好像和往常不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "3d9419f0ee3efe1703ba1898cf6eb5ac048cafc0c500261c09ecf17b4935a7e8", "ja": "悩みっていうか……\nあのね、みんなには言えなかったんだケド。", "zh": "说是烦恼嘛……\n那个啊，我没能跟其他人开口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "07856c6df212bb1eb12432a792d40955e1328289d21d3403faba6ff79f5c49c3", "ja": "ワタシ、メグミと仲直りしてから……\nなんだか胸がチクチクして、モヤモヤするノ。", "zh": "我和惠美和好之后……不知怎么的，胸口一阵阵刺痛，心里也闷闷的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "fcda574a631f05aef98b93b2a50d06d774e55af9ba886d0b6740481cfa777a94", "ja": "どうしてなんだろう？って考えたんだけど、\nわからなくて。ちゃんと仲直りできたのに……。", "zh": "我想过这是为什么，可还是想不明白。明明已经好好和好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2aa13819847a3b2af538f4329b0b946b5a9b0441f0b5d12a80eb7d5d3370dea7", "ja": "そうか……。\nもしかして、だからかな？", "zh": "这样啊……\n难道是因为这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f5b3144ac132db8c04937a9a657a2686bf8a5ab2abcc31f82d75ef815a601ebd", "ja": "わからないことを『知りたい』と思うその気持ちが、\n恋に似ていたのかもな。", "zh": "想要了解未知事物的那份心情，或许就像恋爱一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "6d720c4b353ee694416a18d7697e2e3082000905bcc7e4d6f3254c7af8d45e95", "ja": "そうなんだ。……じゃあワタシは、その\n『わからないコト』に恋してるのかナ？", "zh": "原来如此。……那么，我是不是爱上了那个“未知的事物”呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "058a0508ac05436b84179f6a983ddec4caabd5b2cea2f2f550b4ad423287294b", "ja": "それってなんだか、切ないネ……。", "zh": "那还真是有点令人难过呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1025_p", "source_sha256": "731d9091b23cea591b532c91f0c0adffe8b745905cc7b26b6b2754ae3d1a0ed0", "ja": "（この曲を歌う事を経て、\nエレナはまたひとつ成長したようだ）", "zh": "（唱这首歌的过程中，艾蕾娜似乎又成长了一步。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_094_1026_p", "source_sha256": "18cc6ce09723b94b4803008a24bfef7178d1fce3b92d4ce57fff77f6b3373796", "ja": "（ドラマの挿入歌……\n誰が選ばれてもおかしくはないな）", "zh": "（电视剧的插曲……无论选中谁都不奇怪啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
